    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d695">

                <pb facs="0802" n="728" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg728"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/3281</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-26T20:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 26, 1918, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 8.43 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1383. Minister for Foreign Affairs informed me to-day that representatives of
                    Norway Foreign Office, Department of Justice, Secret Service and Legation at
                    Petrograd have gone to Copenhagen to meet Swedish and Danish representatives
                    with a view to working out a uniform policy in regard to Bolshevism.</p>
                <p>In reply to a question Minister of Foreign Affairs stated that this Government
                    does not anticipate an actual Bolshevik outbreak in Norway.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
